The pharmacy delivers medicine free of charge within the Cape Town CBD on weekdays, a practical option for office workers and residents of the city centre''s apartment blocks who cannot always collect in person. An after-hours emergency line also means urgent medical needs are not limited to normal trading hours, a useful safety net in a busy inner-city neighbourhood with limited late-night healthcare options nearby.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'barrs-pharmacy-cape-town-cbd' AND description = 'Barr''s Pharmacy is an A-graded pharmacy on Long Street offering free medicine delivery within the Cape Town CBD on weekdays, plus an after-hours emergency line.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
