-- cape-town-hollow-boutique-hotel-gardens (general)
UPDATE businesses SET description = 'Cape Town Hollow Boutique Hotel is a 4-star hotel on Queen Victoria Street in Gardens, operating from the same address since 2003. Rooms are split between mountain-facing options with views toward Table Mountain and standard rooms for guests prioritising value, giving the property a reasonably wide range for a boutique-sized hotel. Its own restaurant, Eighty-Ate, handles in-house dining, sparing guests the need to head out for every meal.

The hotel sits a short walk from the Company''s Garden, placing guests close to the Iziko museums, the National Gallery and the restaurants of lower Kloof and Long Streets without the noise of being directly on them. That balance of a quieter residential-feeling street with central access suits travellers who want to explore the city centre on foot and return to a calmer base at the end of the day.', description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'cape-town-hollow-boutique-hotel-gardens' AND description = 'Cape Town Hollow Boutique Hotel is a 4-star hotel that has operated on Queen Victoria Street since 2003, offering mountain-facing and standard rooms plus its own restaurant, Eighty-Ate, a short walk from the Company''s Garden.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
